# UI GENERAL SETTINGS
# ×××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××
set guioptions ""
set window-title-basename true
set page-padding 1
set scrollbars false
set selection-clipboard "clipboard"

# Padding & Geometry
set statusbar-h-padding 0
set statusbar-v-padding 0

# ×××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××
# COLOR PALETTE (Light / High Contrast White)
# ×××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××
# Default Page & Window Backgrounds
set default-bg "#ffffff"
set default-fg "#000000"

# Recolor / High Contrast Mode (Toggled via 'i')
set recolor "false"
set recolor-lightcolor "#ffffff"
set recolor-darkcolor "#000000"

# Status Bar & Input Bar
set statusbar-bg "#ffffff"
set statusbar-fg "#000000"
set inputbar-bg "#ffffff"
set inputbar-fg "#000000"

# Completion Menu (Popup when typing commands)
set completion-bg "#ffffff"
set completion-fg "#000000"
set completion-highlight-bg "#000000"
set completion-highlight-fg "#ffffff"

# Text Selection & Search Highlights
set highlight-color "#41b25b36"
set highlight-active-color "#759b61"
set notification-bg "#ffffff"
set notification-fg "#000000"
set notification-error-bg "#ffffff"
set notification-error-fg "#ff0000"

# ×××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××
# KEYBINDINGS
# ×××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××××
# Navigation & View Modes
map f toggle_fullscreen
map i recolor
map [normal] <BackSpace> navigate previous

# Fullscreen Adjustment Behavior
map [fullscreen] a adjust_window best-fit
map [fullscreen] s adjust_window width